      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "injectors only: @Inject at the TAIL of Forge's ServerLifecycleHooks.handleServerStopping and right before handleServerStopped's PUTSTATIC currentServer (common), @Inject at the HEAD of ForgeHooksClient.handleClientLevelClosing (client); helper bons.furious.patch.closed_world_release.ClosedWorldRelease (reflection on already-loaded classes only; each mod's part applies only when its class is loaded and its field has the expected static type; the mods' guard lines are audit lines, satisfied while that mod is not installed)",
